@matrix @shipping
Feature: Shipping price matrix
  Base price per zone plus a price per kilogram, for parcels of 0.1 to 10 kg.

  Scenario Outline: <zone> parcel of <kg> kg
    Then shipping to zone <zone> for <kg> kg costs <cost> EUR

